ning Housing & Dining Dining Services Residence Life Lyon Education & Adventure Program Wright Wilderness Experience Outdoor Trips & Events Bouldering Wall Challenge Course Disc Golf Course Hiking and Biking Trail Gallery Rental Gear Waivers & Evals LEAP DEI and EEC Information Lyon League Lyon Lift Mobile App Need Help With An Event? Pet Life Pet Life FAQ Pet Life Press Release Pet Policy Campus Pet Requirements Letter From Presidential Pet Campus Pet Application Form Stay Connected Alumni, Parents, & Friends 1872 Society Alumni Association Alumni Awards Alumni Personnel Donor Honor Roll How to Give Stay Involved Why Your Gift Matters Advancement Honor Roll of Donors Alumni Giving The Honor Roll of Donors Mobile App Student Handbook Student Involvement Campus Employment Religious Life Civic Engagement Lyon College Recyclers Greek Life Alpha Xi Delta Chi Omicron Kappa Sigma Phi Mu Tau Kappa Epsilon SAC Student Government Student Organizations Black Student Association MLK Day MLK Day Program Student Life Dean of Students Fitness Facilities Game Room Cardio Room Free Store SOS Pantry Scots Spirit Wear Store The Social and Honor System Title IX Title IX Personnel Title IX Policy Title IX FAQs File a Title IX Report Title IX Support and Resources The Wheelbarrow Contact Resources Contact Us Event Request Application Give Job Opportunities Marketing Request News Report a Concern Information Technology Information Technology IT by the Numbers IT Announcements FAQs/Knowledgebase Governance Links Footer Right Nav Course & Exam Schedules Stay Connected Style Guide Net Price Calculator The Highlander Newspaper Community Calendar News Request a Transcript Schedule a Tour Mobile menu and search toggle Search Honors Fellows Welcome Days CampusDroneShot ThomasRockets TheatreStudents Professor Teaching Irosha's Atom Photo SCARF Highlight 1 CampusDroneShot 2 ThomasRockets 3 TheatreStudents 4 Professor Teaching 5 Irosha's Atom Photo 6 SCARF Highlight 7 Academics Honors Fellows Honors Fellows Welcome Days Related Explore Lyon Honors Fellows Welcome Days We can't wait to meet you Schedule a visit Apply Today Honors Lunch and Learn Invitations Students who qualify with a 27 ACT or 1250 or better on the SAT or scoring an unweighted 3.7 GPA or better are invited to register. In both cases, a student must also meet proficiencies in ENG001 and MTH001 prior to matriculation. Honors-qualified students are encouraged to regularly check their email inbox for an invitation to our weekly Honors Lunch and Learn events, held each Friday. These special campus visit experiences are designed exclusively for prospective Honors students and provide a personalized opportunity to explore Lyon College more deeply. Each Lunch and Learn includes: Campus Tour – 11 a.m. Lunch with Director of Honors Fellows Program and Associate Professor of Spanish Dr. Stephanie Saunders, – 12 p.m. Customized Activities based on your interests, which may include: Meeting with a professor Connecting with Financial Aid Visiting with an Admissions Counselor Sitting in on a class Other requested experiences These Fridays are a great opportunity to envision yourself as part of the Lyon Honors community while receiving individualized attention and guidance. Be sure to watch your email for your invitation and reserve your spot early. Sign your Letter of Commitment today! If the Honors Fellows Program is right up your alley, be sure to fill out the Honors Fellows Letter of Commitment. Submitting your Letter of Commitment will hold your place in the Honors Fellows Program, so we encourage you not to delay! Questions? Please contact the Office of Admissions at (870) 307-7250 or admissions@lyon.edu . For information on lodging, restaurants, and things to do in Batesville, see our Around Town page. Lyon College Start Your Future Lyon is more than just a college. It's a community distinguished by its academic curriculum, unique honor and social systems, and award-winning professors. Apply Today Contact Resources Contact Us Event Request Application Give Job Opportunities Marketing Request News Report a Concern Footer Right Nav Course & Exam Schedules Stay Connected Style Guide Net Price Calculator The Highlander Newspaper Community Calendar tik-tok-icon-black 2300 Highland Road • Batesville, Arkansas 72501 • Phone: (870) 307-7000 • Fax: (870) 307-7001 2026 © Speak Creative. All rights reserved. Sitemap | Privacy Policy |"
