aculty and Staff Related Explore Lyon Resources for Faculty and Staff We can't wait to meet you Schedule a visit Apply Today Resources Lyon College offers faculty and staff an Employee Assistance Program (EAP) that offers a limited amount of therapy visits within their system or will cover some cost of seeing another therapist. Check out the handouts below for more information. Employee Assistance Program Informational Document Employee Assistance Program Brochure Nicole Smith, MSN, APRN, PMHNP-BC Nicole Smith , MSN, APRN, PMHNP-BC  is credentialed through the American Nurses Credentialing Center as a psychiatric mental health nurse practitioner. Nicole comes to campus once a month and is available to see students, faculty and staff for medication management. This is a billable service. Please call the White River Behavioral Clinic for insurance and payment verification. If you are interested in making an appointment with Nicole, please contact the Behavioral Clinic at 870.698.2100 and fill out this informational packet . Wellness Wednesday Victoria sends out a bi-weekly Wellness Wednesday email to all faculty and staff to promote self care, wellness and overall health. Be on the lookout in your email for your biweekly dose of wellness care! Lyon College Start Your Future Lyon is more than just a college. It's a community distinguished by its academic curriculum, unique honor and social systems, and award-winning professors. Apply Today Contact Resources Contact Us Event Request Application Give Job Opportunities Marketing Request News Report a Concern Footer Right Nav Course & Exam Schedules Stay Connected Style Guide Net Price Calculator The Highlander Newspaper Community Calendar tik-tok-icon-black 2300 Highland Road • Batesville, Arkansas 72501 • Phone: (870) 307-7000 • Fax: (870) 307-7001 2026 © Speak Creative. All rights reserved. Sitemap | Privacy Policy |"
