yon Job Opportunities We can't wait to meet you Schedule a visit Apply Today As a continuously expanding institution, Lyon College is committed to building a learning and working environment where members from all backgrounds can live, learn, and thrive. Explore job opportunities for faculty and staff and expand your limitless career potential with Lyon. View Current Opportunities Contacts For information about the Office of Human Resources and job openings at Lyon, contact the director of human resources. Employment is contingent upon a satisfactory background check. Lyon College is an equal employment opportunity employer. Deanna Taylor Human Resources Manager Office located in the Nichols Administration Building 870.307.7309 | deanna.taylor@lyon.edu Rebecca Varela Human Resources Manager Office located in the Nichols Administration Building 870.307.7324 | rebecca.varela@lyon.edu Lyon College Start Your Future Lyon is more than just a college. It's a community distinguished by its academic curriculum, unique honor and social systems, and award-winning professors. Apply Today Contact Resources Contact Us Event Request Application Give Job Opportunities Marketing Request News Report a Concern Footer Right Nav Course & Exam Schedules Stay Connected Style Guide Net Price Calculator The Highlander Newspaper Community Calendar tik-tok-icon-black 2300 Highland Road • Batesville, Arkansas 72501 • Phone: (870) 307-7000 • Fax: (870) 307-7001 2026 © Speak Creative. All rights reserved. Sitemap | Privacy Policy |"
